  "changed_since_previous": "No substantial changes to the approach or diff scope.",
  "card": "Annotates CBlockIndex fields nTx and m_chain_tx_count with GUARDED_BY(cs_main) and acquires cs_main in reader RPCs to resolve thread safety violations. Currently, getblockheader reads nTx without holding cs_main, and getchaintxstats and dumptxoutset read m_chain_tx_count without locking while those fields can be concurrently written during block receipt, pruned-node redownload, or AssumeUTXO validation. The PR removes the AssertLockNotHeld check in blockheaderToJSON and acquires cs_main during these reads.",
